DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260831T143000
UID:6a1078d4fab4ff0f649ae907@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us to watch the film and enjoy making a themed craft or c
 olouring.\nBased on the beloved book series by Dav Pilkey\, Dog Man follow
 s the adventures of a half-dog\, half-man crimefighter who is sworn to pro
 tect and serve. As he doggedly pursues the mischievous feline supervillain
 \, Petey the Cat\, chaos\, laughter\, and heroic antics ensue in this fun-
 filled animated adventure for the whole family.\nAge Rating: PG\nRun Time:
  1h 29m\nFor Families. Drop in.
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a1078d4fab4ff0f649ae907
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
