BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seniors Celebrating Seniors: A Musical Walk Down Memory Lane
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T150000
UID:6a21dd2bc7d3cd58005e21c6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Jerry and Peter for an engaging and nostalgic musical exp
 erience featuring a rich selection of beloved songs from the 1950s and 196
 0s. Accomplished multi-instrumentalists\, they will perform on a variety o
 f instruments including guitar\, bass\, violin\, and accordion\, bringing 
 timeless classics to life. This interactive\, one-hour program invites pa
 rticipants to reminisce and share personal memories connected to the music
 \, fostering a warm and inclusive atmosphere. Celebrating the power of mus
 ic to connect generations\, this program offers a meaningful opportunity f
 or seniors to reflect\, engage\, and enjoy an uplifting communal experienc
 e.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Main Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a21dd2bc7d3cd58005e21c6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
