DESCRIPTION:For ages 6 to 12.  Registration opens July 15.\nGet ready to 
 mix\, stretch\, and squish in this hands-on slime-making program where ki
 ds will learn the basics of simple science while creating their very own b
 atch of mermaid slime to take home. We’ll explore textures\, colors\, a
 nd fun chemical reactions in a safe and supervised environment. All materi
 als will be provided—just bring your curiosity and be ready to get a lit
 tle messy!\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on th
 is form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Librar
 ies Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be
