  participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously s
 upported\, in part\, by donors.\nSeptember:  Marble Run\nMarble Run is a f
 un track where marbles roll down using gravity. Children can build tracks 
 with tubes\, ramps\, and tunnels\, then watch the marbles race to the fini
 sh. In this program\, kids will explore\, create\, test\, and improve thei
 r own marble runs. They will learn about gravity\, speed\, and problem-sol
 ving while having fun.\nLet's build\, play\, and discover together!\nOctob
 er: Robotic Fun
