 earn about what Orange Shirt Day is\, why we observe it\, and listen to a
  reading of The Orange Shirt Story by Phyllis Webstad. After the story\, 
 kids can get creative by making heart crafts and decorating their own pap
 er orange shirt to celebrate kindness\, empathy and respect\, and honour 
 the truth that Every Child Matters.\nFor kids ages 9-12.\nThis is a staff-
 led program using resources developed by The Orange Shirt Society.\nIf you
