BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Harry Turns 70! Celebrating Canadian Illustrators
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260615T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260830T235959
UID:6a062ed1c6a1dc3d00d3c6ee@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Harry the Dirty Dog turns 70!\nCelebrate 70 years of a beloved
  classic and the illustrations behind it. This exhibit highlights the work
  of Margaret Bloy Graham and her ability to bring stories to life through 
 her artwork. Visit the Osborne collection to experience our exhibit\, whic
 h also spotlights the contributions of Canadian illustrators\, featuring w
 orks from artists all across the country.\nThe exhibit can be viewed durin
 g the Osborne Collection's open hours. Located on the 4th floor of the Li
 llian H. Smith Branch.
