DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260902T150000
UID:6a51136d0e562e280098ebe3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for small group visits with therapy animals. Children 
 will have an opportunity to read\, listen to stories and engage in therape
 utic human-animal interaction. Experience the joy and calming benefits of
  a certified therapy animal from One Health Partners.\nRegistration is req
 uired. Register online through the website\, or call 416-393-7720 or visit
  the Riverdale Branch in person.\nDaycares and Camps\, please call 416-393
