UID:6a510f000e562e280098eafc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Our book selection for August is\nThe Hundred Dresses\nby Elea
 nor Estes. Wanda wears the same faded blue dress to school every day\, yet
  she says she has one hundred beautiful dresses at home "all lined up." El
 eanor Este's heartfelt story\, a Newberry Honor Book and a beloved classic
  for more than eighty years\, offers a timeless message of compassion and 
 understanding.\nCopies available at the library.\nThe Hundred Dresses
