DESCRIPTION:For ages 9 to 12.\nGet ready to laugh\, create\, and compete i
 n the Improv Olympics! Through fun theatre games\, storytelling challenges
 \, and team events\, participants will build confidence\, creativity\, and
  teamwork skills. Earn points for your team\, tackle hilarious improv chal
 lenges\, and discover the joy of thinking on your feet. No acting experien
 ce required!\nThis is a 6-week program and participants are recommended to
  attend all 6 sessions.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal info
 rmation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the 
