DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun!\nFor ages 6-12 years old.\nSnacks are offered during the After Schoo
 l Club for participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are ge
 nerously supported\, in part\, by donors.\nMonday\, September 28:\nCraft!\
 nHave fun after school doing one hour of crafts! Make an ornament\, decora
 tion\, or dream catcher!\nBring your creativity & explore with a variety 
 of crafting supplies\, like old discs\, yarn\, & beads!\nAll crafting supp
 lies will be provided.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal infor
 mation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the P
 ublic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information 
 will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evalua
 tion. Questions about how the library handles your information can be dire
 cted to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yong
 e Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Morningside\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a885b1bbe1482002988fbe9
