DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T160000
UID:6a7ca9382c859e0086ae67d9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join other local jigsaw puzzle enthusiasts for an afternoon of
  communal puzzling. Bring your own puzzle or try out one of the puzzles pr
 ovided. Drop-in anytime from 2-4PM.\nHave a puzzle you aren’t using anym
 ore? Bring it in & swap it for another to take home with you. Please note 
 that the puzzle swap will only take place during the program time.
LOCATION:Parliament Street\, Main Floor Program Room
